  "en": "The four lines with their default scenarios, and every scenario the documents name: templated, folded into another, or without a template — the last two with the reason stated here rather than in prose (FYL-DESIGN-17 E-8 / E-17). GENERATED by tools/make-scenario-templates.py."
 },
